# fsla-results' environment (MODULE.bazel's `environment.python` tag `results_env`): the repository is data, and its
# checks are fsla_devtools' (the environment installs it from the module's source), which is standard library only, so
# the lock holds no package. Compiled with `uv pip compile requirements.in --python-version 3.11 --generate-hashes -o
# requirements.lock`.
